---
source: promql-engine/tests/plan/aggregators.rs
expression: "sum by (job) (rate(http_requests_total[5m]))"
---
Projection: labels{job: __group__job}
  Aggregate: sum by (job) (samples, 600000..1200000 step 30s) per block
    Projection: labels{job, pod}
      SeriesEval: rate(samples[5m], 600000..1200000 step 30s) per series per block
        TableScan: http_requests_total
